msgctxt "112"
msgid "What are ya, invincible or something? Christ..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"You depend too much on your guns. Your close-combat skills\r\n"
"suffer for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Shit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "So many guns... You buy weapons for the Reapers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Heh... That's right. And I'm not a hitman, just so\r\n"
"you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "You're not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yeah, I am. I met the Reaper boss a while back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Procuring weapons is my specialty. Sounded like a sweet\r\n"
"deal, so I signed on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Who is in charge of the Reapers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Can't tell you that, now, can I? I'm very careful about\r\n"
"guarding my clients' privacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"(Looks like that's all I'm gonna get out of him... I'll\r\n"
"leave the rest to Ibuki.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Hey! You guys are useless!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Had enough yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "You're really startin' to piss me off now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "I'll kill you myself! Die, you bastard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "What are you, some kind of freak...!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter how many small fry you throw at me. Give up already and come "
"with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Son of a bitch..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Hey, Samejima-san. I'm back⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "What the hell!? What's goin' on here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "You're just in time! Mow this asshole down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Huh? I still don't know what's goin' on, but whatever you say, boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Nice to meet ya, mister! Lemme introduce you to my gun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Who the hell are you, barging in here like this!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Are you Samejima?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "What if I am, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"I'm with the Honest Living Association. I need you to come\r\n"
"with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "The HLA...!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Hey, boys! Looks like we got ourselves an uninvited guest\r\n"
"here!"
msgstr ""

